<title>ISRAEL: Israel's June trade gap widens to $767.6 mln m/m.</title>
<headline>Israel's June trade gap widens to $767.6 mln m/m.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's trade deficit in June totalled $767.6 million, the Central Bureau of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     June 97   May 97    June 96  Jan-June 97  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>Exports    1,664     1,689     1,568    10,165	  9,279</p>
<p>Imports    2,431     2,378     2,482    14,490	 14,859</p>
<p>Balance    - 767.6   - 688.9   - 914    -4,326	 -5,580</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
